{"Shortly before \0031 a.m.\004, he answered a knock at the back door and admitted five men, two of whom were expert carpenters.","The Nameless Ones","John Connolly",true},
{"I want to shout and scream, but I would be screaming at a wall. I storm off to my bedroom. Thirty minutes later, she leaves the house with Gboyega.\nShe doesn’t return till \0031 a.m.\004\nI don’t sleep till 1 a.m.","My Sister, the Serial Killer","Oyinkan Braithwaite",true},
